                                                "sense_id": "40563f5d-e3e1-3150-8c46-6b412b9a73ef",
                                                "text": "The new livery features the native mountain hare and its predator the eagle, reflecting the wildlife of the mountain most known for their speed and agility."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b50e0bb-5181-3e12-8809-863e205e284e",
                                        "entry_id": "c1808ef7-5c13-384a-8e36-01549c8d7693",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various hares found in mountainous country, especially a snowshoe hare (Lepus americanus) or a white-tailed jackrabbit (Lepus townsendi)."
